( https://albiononline.com/shop/vanity#137 )

Adventurer,

The *Zealot Vanity Bundle ( https://albiononline.com/shop/vanity#137 )* is =
here! This brand-new premiere bundle is available to buy now, and includes =
a full costume set along with the *Cursed Hound* Mount Skin for your *Direw=
olf* base mount.

This bundle will give your character the chilling aura of a fanatical follo=
wer of Morgana. With deathly pale skin shrouded by a dark hood, and metalli=
c protrusions giving off a demonic, red glow, you=E2=80=99ll embody the dar=
k arts practiced by those who reject knightly virtue. The bundle also inclu=
des the equally chilling Cursed Hound Mount Skin, with blood-red patches an=
d a hefty, iron bridle.

Grab this premiere bundle today and become a disciple of darkness!

( https://albiononline.com/news/morgana-challenge-2023 )

The Morgana Challenge Returns
-----------------------------

The Disciples of Morgana have re-emerged from the shadows... and for the en=
tire month of May, you can take the *Morgana Challenge* to collect fantasti=
c rewards. Earn points for open-world activities, unlock chests to get valu=
able loot, and claim your very own Morgana Raven mount.

As always, you can earn Challenge Points by *gathering, fishing, farming, a=
nd killing monsters*. Points count simultaneously toward a daily bonus, a w=
eekly unlockable chest, and the monthly mount. So log in, head out into the=
 open world, gather points, and claim your rewards!

( https://albiononline.com/news/referral-may-2023 )

Refer One Friend and Get the Ironjaw Hyena
------------------------------------------

Another Referral Season has begun, and until June 1 you can claim the *Iron=
jaw Hyena* with a single referral!

This skin transforms your Direwolf base mount into a wild, warlike canine g=
irded in iron - and once you=E2=80=99ve unlocked it, it can be used by any =
of your characters on that particular server (either Albion East or West).

This Referral Season lasts until 23:59:59 UTC on May 31, so invite your fri=
ends and enjoy these rewards!

LEARN MORE ( https://albiononline.com/news/referral-may-2023 )

